# fastlane
#
# It is recommended to not store the screenshots in the git repo.
# Instead, use fastlane to re-generate the screenshots whenever they are needed.
# For more information about the recommended setup visit:
# https://docs.fastlane.tools/best-practices/source-control/#source-control

fastlane/report.xml
fastlane/Preview.html
fastlane/screenshots/**/*.png
fastlane/test_output
# Spike 01 build output — all of this rebuilds from `npm run build` and
# `node tools/make-corpus.js`. The corpus and img/ fixtures are committed on
# purpose, so a later latency comparison runs against identical input.
spike-01/editor/public/bundle.js
spike-01/editor/public/bundle.js.map
spike-01/editor/public/vendor/
spike-01/editor/tools/.corpus-source.txt
spike-01/*/notes/
